WEBVTT

02:11.810 --> 02:14.730
<b>This isn't just about
machine lifeforms going berserk?</b>

02:16.740 --> 02:20.870
<b><i>2B, there are multiple readings for
hostile machine lifeforms in the city ruins.</i></b>

02:20.870 --> 02:23.450
<b><i>There is an order
for all YoRHa Soldiers to intercept!</i></b>

02:23.780 --> 02:26.910
<b><i>You now have permission
to use additional weapons.</i></b>

02:26.910 --> 02:29.040
<b><i>I will transfer the data to your Pod.</i></b>

02:29.920 --> 02:33.040
<b><i>But please don't be reckless, okay?</i></b>

02:33.380 --> 02:34.420
<b>Yeah.</b>

02:41.430 --> 02:44.430
<b><i>This is the 12C north defense headquarters!</i></b>

02:44.430 --> 02:46.850
<b><i>Is anyone listening to this broadcast?</i></b>

02:46.850 --> 02:49.350
<b><i>I am 42S in charge of public relations!</i></b>

02:49.560 --> 02:54.360
<b><i>Currently our defense facility is surrounded
by multiple machine lifeforms.</i></b>

02:54.360 --> 02:55.860
<b><i>And at this rate...</i></b>

02:56.820 --> 03:02.820
<b><i>The Council of Humanity has a message for all
of our brave androids fighting on the surface.</i></b>

03:03.410 --> 03:06.620
<b><i>Currently, the combat
against machine lifeforms...</i></b>

03:09.250 --> 03:12.250
<b>We need to raise
the weapon grade already! That way—</b>

03:12.250 --> 03:13.460
<b>We can't.</b>

03:13.460 --> 03:17.090
<b>If that furthers the enemy's evolution,
we will be in a stalemate.</b>

03:17.090 --> 03:19.170
<b>Yeah, but at the rate we're going...</b>

03:19.170 --> 03:21.010
<b>What about contact with the other camps?</b>

03:21.010 --> 03:23.340
<b>We still haven't gotten any contact.</b>

03:23.510 --> 03:25.640
<b>I believe they're in
the same situation we are.</b>

03:25.800 --> 03:27.600
<b>We have a report from the scouts!</b>

03:27.600 --> 03:30.100
<b>The second wave has roughly 200,000 units!</b>

03:30.100 --> 03:31.440
<b>200,000!?</b>

03:31.440 --> 03:35.020
<b>We can't deal with 200,000 right now!</b>

03:35.150 --> 03:37.820
<b>Just when we thought
the first wave settled down.</b>

03:41.400 --> 03:44.200
<b><i>Jackass! How is it? Can you
shave them off on your end?</i></b>

03:47.030 --> 03:50.410
<b>No. It's never-ending!
We're going to pull back for now!</b>

03:56.790 --> 03:59.050
<b>Damn it! They keep spawning
without limit!</b>

03:59.050 --> 04:02.010
<b>Lily, I don't think we can hold out over here!</b>

04:02.260 --> 04:04.640
<b>After all the effort
I went through to capture it.</b>

04:04.930 --> 04:08.140
<b>Both of you,
pull back to somewhere safe for now.</b>

04:09.180 --> 04:11.640
<b>Lily, at this rate...</b>

04:11.640 --> 04:14.140
<b>Leader, when we consider
how much ammo is left...</b>

04:14.140 --> 04:15.520
<b>Let's retreat!</b>

04:15.520 --> 04:19.940
<b>But even if we run, there are machine lifeforms
everywhere, so where do we run to?</b>

04:21.900 --> 04:23.110
<b>Lily!</b>

04:23.400 --> 04:25.610
<b>2B! You came for us!</b>

04:26.410 --> 04:28.990
<b>You're that YoRHa Soldier
from the other day.</b>

04:29.120 --> 04:30.330
<b>What's your status?</b>

04:31.660 --> 04:34.290
<b>They suddenly started invading.</b>

04:34.670 --> 04:37.040
<b>At first, we were able to fight back.</b>

04:37.040 --> 04:41.800
<b>However, there was one unit that was
terribly strong, and in order to defeat it...</b>

04:42.590 --> 04:45.130
<b>We lost half of our forces.</b>

04:45.630 --> 04:47.600
<b>A terribly strong unit.</b>

04:47.800 --> 04:49.510
<b>What about the other YoRHa Soldiers?</b>

04:49.760 --> 04:53.600
<b>I don't know.
This entire city is under attack.</b>

04:53.600 --> 04:57.190
<b>We have orders to intercept them, but there's
much confusion surrounding the situation.</b>

04:57.190 --> 04:58.900
<b>All over the city...</b>

04:58.900 --> 05:00.610
<b>What are we going to do?</b>

05:00.610 --> 05:03.990
<b>Pod. Is the weapon you downloaded
earlier ready for use?</b>

05:04.150 --> 05:06.820
<b><i>Report. Ready for use.</i></b>

05:12.200 --> 05:14.120
<b>Amazing.</b>

05:14.330 --> 05:17.830
<b>I have an idea. Lily, I want you
to gather everyone here.</b>

05:18.210 --> 05:21.840
<b>Even YoRHa units have limits
in what you can do by yourself.</b>

05:22.380 --> 05:24.970
<b>You don't have to force yourself
to stay with us.</b>

05:24.970 --> 05:27.550
<b>Pod. Prepare laser relay system contact.</b>

05:27.800 --> 05:29.050
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

05:29.930 --> 05:31.810
<b>YoRHa Soldiers to the south</b>

05:31.810 --> 05:35.350
<b>encountered and entered combat
against hostile machine lifeforms.</b>

05:35.520 --> 05:39.310
<b>50,000 hostile machine lifeforms are on the move
towards the city ruins Resistance camp.</b>

05:35.520 --> 05:39.810
<b>Infantry units are fighting multiple Goliath-class
machine lifeforms in the skies above the city ruins.</b>

05:39.310 --> 05:41.480
<b>They are on the defensive.</b>

05:39.810 --> 05:42.730
<b>YoRHa Soldiers to the east
are requesting backup.</b>

05:41.480 --> 05:44.030
<b>30,000 enemy units are on the move
towards the city ruins from the desert area.</b>

05:42.730 --> 05:45.440
<b>Contact nearby squads
that can head over! Hurry!</b>

05:44.030 --> 05:45.990
<b>Perform emergency equipment change of all
spare Type-H and Type-O units into Type-B,</b>

05:45.440 --> 05:48.360
<b>Laser relay system to 12C north defense
headquarters has been severed!</b>

05:45.990 --> 05:47.070
<b>and have them head over to the catapult!</b>

05:47.070 --> 05:50.030
<b>Underwater lookout net senses heat sources,
presumed to be machine lifeforms.</b>

05:48.360 --> 05:50.910
<b>Aircraft carrier Blueridge I
has sunk off the coast of the sunken city.</b>

05:50.030 --> 05:53.990
<b>Emergency laser relay network construction,
50 percent complete.</b>

05:50.910 --> 05:53.990
<b>11B's black box signal has stopped.</b>

05:54.750 --> 06:01.840
<b><i>Commander. You have already submitted
18 requests for this project.</i></b>

06:02.130 --> 06:06.260
<b><i>You surely understand
what this means for you.</i></b>

06:06.970 --> 06:09.550
<b>I am the commander
of the YoRHa Soldiers.</b>

06:09.720 --> 06:12.100
<b>If the outcome is to lessen
how quickly my squads wear down,</b>

06:12.100 --> 06:15.770
<b>I believe that stating my objection
is part of my duties.</b>

06:16.100 --> 06:18.560
<b><i>Even that has limits.</i></b>

06:18.940 --> 06:23.150
<b><i>We will also reject the use of satellite lasers
that you additionally requested.</i></b>

06:23.400 --> 06:27.030
<b>Why? If we don't act, the YoRHa Soldiers
will be wiped out,</b>

06:27.030 --> 06:29.910
<b>and there is a possibility that the significance
of this project will be eradicated.</b>

06:29.910 --> 06:34.370
<b><i>We Council of Humanity will decide
the significance of this project.</i></b>

06:34.450 --> 06:36.040
<b><i>This is not your concern.</i></b>

06:36.790 --> 06:38.580
<b><i>You should be fully aware</i></b>

06:38.960 --> 06:44.090
<b><i>that we are not allowed to rest
until we attain God through Process 11.</i></b>

06:44.590 --> 06:49.800
<b><i>Don't lose sight of your role in this project,
and its significance.</i></b>

06:50.510 --> 06:52.600
<b><i>That is all we have to say.</i></b>

06:53.100 --> 06:56.350
<b><i>Glory to mankind.</i></b>

06:56.930 --> 06:59.770
<b>Glory to mankind.</b>

07:03.520 --> 07:06.980
<b>So I must repeat it all over again.</b>

07:17.500 --> 07:20.580
<b>Lily! They'll reach
the arranged spot shortly!</b>

07:20.870 --> 07:23.880
<b>All right. Pull back immediately
and come join us.</b>

07:33.470 --> 07:34.510
<b>Now!</b>

07:34.510 --> 07:37.220
<b>All units, deploy EMP cancellers!</b>

08:06.290 --> 08:07.380
<b>Success!</b>

08:07.500 --> 08:09.880
<b><i>They've all ceased to function!</i></b>

08:15.050 --> 08:16.260
<b>9S.</b>

08:16.260 --> 08:17.260
<b>Oh boy.</b>

08:17.680 --> 08:20.270
<b>It looks like I somehow made it, 2B.</b>

08:20.810 --> 08:22.810
<b>Thank you, 9S.</b>

08:22.890 --> 08:24.060
<b>Both of you from YoRHa.</b>

08:24.400 --> 08:26.860
<b>On behalf of the Resistance,
I thank you.</b>

08:27.020 --> 08:29.190
<b>It would've been a dangerous situation
without you.</b>

08:29.440 --> 08:33.110
<b>I'm only paying you back for sending
my body to the Bunker.</b>

08:33.110 --> 08:35.200
<b>You saying so saves us a lot of trouble.</b>

08:35.570 --> 08:39.580
<b>From here, we'll clean up
the remaining machine...</b>

08:41.950 --> 08:42.910
<b>Rain?</b>

09:08.190 --> 09:12.400
<b><i>Alert. Special hostile unit signal detected.</i></b>

09:12.400 --> 09:14.200
<b>Special unit?</b>

09:14.200 --> 09:15.700
<b>Hey! Beyond the building!</b>

09:18.910 --> 09:21.290
<b>What is that?</b>

09:35.630 --> 09:37.180
<b>The special unit from the other day?</b>

09:37.840 --> 09:41.810
<b>It's too big. Is this a machine lifeform?</b>

09:45.890 --> 09:48.770
<b>Though it's a special unit,
this is utter nonsense.</b>

09:50.270 --> 09:52.400
<b>Looks like I won't have time to collect data.</b>

09:52.400 --> 09:53.730
<b>Damn it!</b>

09:53.730 --> 09:55.360
<b>Idiot! What do you think you're...</b>

10:03.290 --> 10:06.580
<b>What? It was all show?
That was scary.</b>

10:07.290 --> 10:11.290
<b><i>Report. Mass transformation
of the special unit detected.</i></b>

10:11.290 --> 10:12.340
<b>It's still alive?</b>

10:24.060 --> 10:26.810
<b><i>Proposal. Immediate retreat.</i></b>

10:26.810 --> 10:27.980
<b>Retreat?</b>

10:28.480 --> 10:31.560
<b>Where can we run
to get away from something like that?</b>

10:32.820 --> 10:35.570
<b>Is it evolving?</b>

10:36.610 --> 10:38.360
<b>2B! Over there!</b>

10:42.070 --> 10:46.120
<b>Hey. We meet again, boy.</b>

10:46.370 --> 10:47.250
<b>That's...</b>

10:49.160 --> 10:53.170
<b>I had a keen interest in humanity.</b>

10:53.420 --> 11:00.380
<b>By unraveling their records,
I was simply charmed by their complexity.</b>

11:00.890 --> 11:02.720
<b>But I figured it out.</b>

11:03.100 --> 11:08.430
<b>Without others to share
those records and knowledge...</b>

11:08.930 --> 11:12.100
<b>This world is utterly meaningless.</b>

11:12.810 --> 11:15.520
<b>Why... Why?</b>

11:17.360 --> 11:20.530
<b>And now, everything must die!</b>

11:28.950 --> 11:30.620
<b>Has it gone berserk?</b>

11:30.620 --> 11:32.330
<b>How can we fight
against something like this?</b>

11:33.830 --> 11:36.210
<b>2B! What in the world is that thing?</b>

11:36.710 --> 11:40.800
<b>That is a core unit that manages
the machine lifeform network.</b>

11:41.180 --> 11:43.430
<b>YoRHa has issued a destruction order for it.</b>

11:43.430 --> 11:47.890
<b>Then if we destroy that huge thing,
all others will cease to function?</b>

11:49.310 --> 11:52.440
<b>Theoretically it should, but how?</b>

11:52.850 --> 11:56.610
<b>In our current situation, getting backup
from the Bunker may be difficult.</b>

11:56.610 --> 11:58.820
<b>Weapons Trader,
can you pull out that thing?</b>

11:59.360 --> 12:03.950
<b>That thing? You mean what we found
during the descent operation?</b>

12:03.990 --> 12:08.080
<b>I mean, I did repair it,
but it's all I can do to fire it.</b>

12:08.080 --> 12:10.500
<b>It's the ace up our sleeve
for times like this, isn't it?</b>

12:10.500 --> 12:13.000
<b>If you can't hit it, we just have
to set things up so it hits.</b>

12:13.000 --> 12:15.460
<b>Set things up so it hits?</b>

12:15.880 --> 12:18.210
<b>Can I hear a bit more about that?</b>

12:18.670 --> 12:19.840
<b>Thank you.</b>

12:19.840 --> 12:23.630
<b>We would like you two from YoRHa
to continue assisting us, too.</b>

12:26.350 --> 12:30.560
<b>Everyone, listen up!
We're going to defeat that big thing!</b>

12:30.930 --> 12:33.480
<b>If you can move, I want you to help us!</b>

12:33.480 --> 12:38.900
<b>If we act in cooperation with YoRHa,
we might be able to end this battle.</b>

12:39.570 --> 12:43.360
<b>But I can't force you to do this.
Because instead of dying here,</b>

12:43.360 --> 12:45.910
<b>there's a path for you to survive and fight.</b>

12:46.120 --> 12:48.160
<b>For injured families and comrades—</b>

12:48.160 --> 12:49.540
<b>We'll do it!</b>

12:49.790 --> 12:52.500
<b>Let's land a big one on those tin cans!</b>

12:52.500 --> 12:54.710
<b>Resistance is all about struggling!</b>

12:54.710 --> 12:58.380
<b>Let's hurry up and blow up
that thing for humanity!</b>

12:58.380 --> 13:00.840
<b>There's plenty of gunpowder left, Leader.</b>

13:00.840 --> 13:01.960
<b>Let's do it!</b>

13:01.960 --> 13:05.180
<b>If that's the case, let's hurry up
and calibrate that thing, Supply Trader.</b>

13:05.180 --> 13:07.550
<b>Looks like we're getting pretty busy.</b>

13:07.550 --> 13:09.890
<b>Thank you. I'm counting on you guys.</b>

13:09.890 --> 13:11.930
<b>Yes, Ma'am!</b>

13:11.930 --> 13:13.600
<b>We're gonna do it.</b>

13:13.600 --> 13:14.770
<b>All right, let's go!</b>

13:14.770 --> 13:18.400
<b>Let's show the guys on the moon
how we tussle!</b>

13:18.560 --> 13:20.900
<b>Those who are alive, come with me!</b>

13:27.660 --> 13:29.580
<b>Miss Lily, do as we planned!</b>

13:30.030 --> 13:33.290
<b><i>Got it. I'm counting on you
to lure it to the spot, 9S.</i></b>

13:34.250 --> 13:35.330
<b>This way!</b>

13:38.710 --> 13:40.380
<b>It's a lot more brittle than expected.</b>

13:40.380 --> 13:44.010
<b><i>Alert. Massive energy signature detected.</i></b>

13:44.090 --> 13:47.590
<b><i>The energy seems to be coming from
a large number of linked machine lifeforms.</i></b>

13:47.590 --> 13:48.720
<b>No way!</b>

13:54.180 --> 13:59.020
<b><i>2B! He seems to be absorbing the lifeforce
of whatever's left on the network!</i></b>

13:59.020 --> 14:02.690
<b><i>I'll hack in and stop the energy supply,
then lure it over!</i></b>

14:02.690 --> 14:03.780
<b>Roger.</b>

14:09.570 --> 14:12.490
<b>We're okay over here!
Heading to the rendezvous point and...</b>

14:12.620 --> 14:13.740
<b>Behind you!</b>

14:19.670 --> 14:21.090
<b>What is that unit?</b>

14:21.090 --> 14:22.210
<b>Be careful!</b>

14:22.210 --> 14:24.510
<b>That's the same type
that took out half our camp!</b>

14:24.960 --> 14:27.800
<b>It's ridiculously tough, and doesn't move
like any of the others!</b>

14:28.300 --> 14:30.430
<b>Understood. Leave this place to me.</b>

14:30.430 --> 14:32.560
<b>Please go ahead
to the rendezvous point and get ready!</b>

14:32.560 --> 14:34.140
<b>Counting on you, 2B.</b>

14:34.140 --> 14:34.970
<b>Let's hurry!</b>

14:39.350 --> 14:41.110
<b>Begin hacking in!</b>

14:45.650 --> 14:48.360
<b>The physical shield
is a lot tougher than I imagined.</b>

14:48.570 --> 14:50.160
<b>This method of hacking won't...</b>

14:59.960 --> 15:01.130
<b>Pascal!</b>

15:18.390 --> 15:19.890
<b>Thank you, Pascal.</b>

15:20.020 --> 15:21.690
<b>Is your village all right?</b>

15:22.020 --> 15:27.900
<b><i>Our village is severed from the network,
so we didn't go haywire.</i></b>

15:28.070 --> 15:29.360
<b>I see.</b>

15:31.280 --> 15:33.950
<b><i>Alert. Equipment of fortification connectors</i></b>

15:33.950 --> 15:37.660
<b><i>by Type-S models
require authorization requests.</i></b>

15:37.660 --> 15:40.080
<b>This isn't the time to be saying that.</b>

15:45.670 --> 15:47.800
<b>Pascal, I have a favor to ask.</b>

15:48.260 --> 15:49.380
<b><i>Okay.</i></b>

15:54.680 --> 15:55.510
<b>So fast.</b>

16:06.820 --> 16:09.030
<b><i>Avenging my family.</i></b>

16:17.160 --> 16:18.080
<b>Pod!</b>

16:18.080 --> 16:19.700
<b>Program A100!</b>

16:21.080 --> 16:22.250
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

16:47.610 --> 16:48.900
<b>9S.</b>

16:49.860 --> 16:53.990
<b>Pascal, evacuate to a safe location
after you drop me.</b>

16:54.910 --> 16:56.280
<b><i>Understood.</i></b>

16:57.320 --> 16:58.280
<b>Pod!</b>

16:58.280 --> 16:59.120
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

17:10.750 --> 17:12.880
<b>Not done yet!</b>

17:15.380 --> 17:17.390
<b>Hacking in!</b>

17:22.180 --> 17:24.640
<b>What is this space?</b>

17:31.780 --> 17:32.900
<b>I...</b>

17:42.950 --> 17:44.540
<b>What is it this time?</b>

17:47.540 --> 17:50.380
<b>Eve... Why...</b>

17:50.880 --> 17:52.170
<b>This guy...</b>

17:58.970 --> 18:01.470
<b>This is humanity's...</b>

18:05.020 --> 18:07.390
<b>Why... Why...</b>

18:07.390 --> 18:10.310
<b>Is his self-consciousness data
starting to collapse?</b>

18:10.650 --> 18:11.610
<b>This isn't good.</b>

18:11.980 --> 18:14.570
<b>I have to execute the program
before it fully collapses.</b>

18:14.740 --> 18:17.780
<b>Thirty percent left
before analysis is complete.</b>

18:31.750 --> 18:34.550
<b>Just a bit more
until the program executes.</b>

18:43.180 --> 18:45.810
<b>Hey, Brother.</b>

18:46.310 --> 18:49.810
<b>I don't want to see you get hurt.</b>

18:50.600 --> 18:54.690
<b>And I especially don't want to lose you.</b>

18:55.070 --> 18:57.700
<b>So, let's go somewhere together.</b>

19:00.160 --> 19:01.410
<b>When did he...</b>

19:02.700 --> 19:04.080
<b>Why?</b>

19:20.550 --> 19:23.720
<b>Confirmed resuming of activity.
It's started coming this way!</b>

19:24.260 --> 19:25.180
<b>We made it in time!</b>

19:25.810 --> 19:29.060
<b><i>This is Lily. As planned, the target
has started moving towards us!</i></b>

19:29.600 --> 19:32.560
<b><i>As soon as preparations are complete,
retreat quickly to safety!</i></b>

19:33.360 --> 19:36.570
<b><i>We will end this battle!</i></b>

19:41.570 --> 19:44.030
<b><i>Target has arrived
at the designated location!</i></b>

19:44.370 --> 19:47.160
<b>Direction, range, and angle properly adjusted!</b>

19:47.500 --> 19:48.160
<b>Fire!</b>

19:52.290 --> 19:53.250
<b>Jackass!</b>

19:53.250 --> 19:54.460
<b>Finally!</b>

20:02.380 --> 20:03.090
<b>Now!</b>

20:23.910 --> 20:25.070
<b>9S!</b>

20:25.070 --> 20:27.120
<b>Wow, we barely made it.</b>

20:27.490 --> 20:30.250
<b>Just in the nick of time!
I'm glad we made it, though.</b>

20:30.250 --> 20:33.500
<b><i>- Yes.
- You really are reckless, Nine-ez.</i></b>

20:33.830 --> 20:36.840
<b>Oh? Did you just call me Nines?</b>

20:37.420 --> 20:38.630
<b><i>You said it, didn't you? Right?</i></b>

20:38.630 --> 20:39.840
<b>End communication.</b>

20:40.840 --> 20:44.840
<b>- Come on, 2B! Sheesh!
<i>- Mr. 9S, that's dangerous!</i></b>

20:45.590 --> 20:48.350
<b>Communications have been severed
because of the explosion.</b>

20:48.930 --> 20:51.890
<b>Search for YoRHa Soldiers on ground,
and set up a rescue squad.</b>

20:51.890 --> 20:54.600
<b>Communications are back online.
Monitors going back up!</b>

20:56.190 --> 20:57.360
<b>What is this?</b>

20:58.020 --> 20:59.570
<b>To think it would still be alive...</b>

21:01.650 --> 21:04.610
<b>With that much mass,
we can't even deflect the trajectory.</b>

